Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs40\pos(183.2,285.867)}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A unit with Santhi...\NA unit with Santhi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,S-S-S-So, Santhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Santhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Clarissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(82.667,206.933)}{\fad(700,0)\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs17}Clarissa\NEarnescorrect
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Clarissa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.28,0:00:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you like to join\Nour unit, Earnescorrect?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You look familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard great things about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have such talent,\Nyet the nobility not to flaunt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Are you planning a solo debut?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you already in a unit with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.34,0:01:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a dance-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever loses has to obey the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs17\pos(300.8,228.978)}Special Judge\NWilista
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,These are our judges.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But why us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs17\pos(133.333,226.844)}Special Judge\NAlestiel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.31,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&\fs17\pos(97.6,230.4)}Special Judge\NAlestiel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...Clarissa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.26,0:01:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What an impressive display of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You both shine so brightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23\pos(188.8,286.933)}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23\pos(202.4,286.933)}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs23}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs18\pos(189.6,286.933)}Because you are the one \Nwho gives me courage!
